<title>ESTONIA: SAKU TO RELEASE RESULTS QUARTERLY.</title>
<headline>SAKU TO RELEASE RESULTS QUARTERLY.</headline>
<dateline>TALLINN 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Saku Brewery said on Thursday it will start to release its financial results four times a year rather than two times a year as earlier stated.</p>
<p>Cardo Remmel, Saku director, said the decision brought Saku into line with the owners of Saku, Finland's Harwall and the Swedish-Norwegian company Pripps Ringnes, which are traded on the Oslo, Helsinki and London bourses.</p>
<p>-- Eva Palu, Tallinn Newsroom, +372 6209 201, reuters@reuters.ee</p>
